      "voiceId": "kg0h9OdkQiGxVLjqbA9B",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 36,
      "file": "CO_08_Richard.mp3",
      "bytes": 40586,
      "line": "And I'm closer than I was last week."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_01",
      "character": "Tom",
      "voiceId": "tUUG2iKsKAbeZBRPSVdO",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 84,
      "file": "A1_01_Tom.mp3",
      "bytes": 95756,
      "line": "Are you Mr Thistlewood? A lady at the market said \u2014 if it's broken, it belongs here."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_02",
      "character": "Richard",
      "voiceId": "kg0h9OdkQiGxVLjqbA9B",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 32,
      "file": "A1_02_Richard.mp3",
      "bytes": 33062,
      "line": "Somebody's been reading my sign."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_03",
      "character": "Tom",
      "voiceId": "tUUG2iKsKAbeZBRPSVdO",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 168,
      "file": "A1_03_Tom.mp3",
      "bytes": 223652,
      "line": "It was my gran's. Hers before that, right back. She left it to me with one instruction. Have it mended. I want it to play again. Only \u2014 it's never played right. Listen."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_04",
      "character": "Peggi",
      "voiceId": "M7xNL3CETIeGmVHN5e8u",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 21,
      "file": "A1_04_Peggi.mp3",
      "bytes": 26793,
      "line": "Ooh, that's terrible."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_05",
      "character": "Albert",
      "voiceId": "jP4TWWVCbVbecdvdfPcS",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 79,
      "file": "A1_05_Albert.mp3",
      "bytes": 109967,
      "line": "It's not terrible, it's \u2014 specific. The same notes are wrong every single time."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_06",
      "character": "Rose",
      "voiceId": "k4rMELAzgoR41hWfYvy0",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 36,
      "file": "A1_06_Rose.mp3",
      "bytes": 56050,
      "line": "Somebody loved this. Loved it loads."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_07",
      "character": "Tom",
      "voiceId": "tUUG2iKsKAbeZBRPSVdO",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 194,
      "file": "A1_07_Tom.mp3",
      "bytes": 240370,
      "line": "Three menders looked at it. Two said scrap it. One said the mechanism's fighting itself \u2014 built wrong on purpose. I just want to do what she asked. And I can't even get it to play a proper song."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_08",
      "character": "Richard",
      "voiceId": "kg0h9OdkQiGxVLjqbA9B",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 78,
      "file": "A1_08_Richard.mp3",
      "bytes": 91995,
      "line": "Nothing is truly broken. It just needs some TLC. Come back at collecting time."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_09",
      "character": "Tom",
      "voiceId": "tUUG2iKsKAbeZBRPSVdO",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 41,
      "file": "A1_09_Tom.mp3",
      "bytes": 30555,
      "line": "Don't you need to know anything about it?"
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_10",
      "character": "Richard",
      "voiceId": "kg0h9OdkQiGxVLjqbA9B",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 23,
      "file": "A1_10_Richard.mp3",
      "bytes": 28047,
      "line": "I expect I'll find out."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_11",
      "character": "Albert",
      "voiceId": "jP4TWWVCbVbecdvdfPcS",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 10,
      "file": "A1_11_Albert.mp3",
      "bytes": 18852,
      "line": "It's open."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_12",
      "character": "Richard",
      "voiceId": "kg0h9OdkQiGxVLjqbA9B",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 57,
      "file": "A1_12_Richard.mp3",
      "bytes": 65245,
      "line": "This time the clothes will be spot on. I've recalibrated."
    },
    {
      "slate": "A1_13",
      "character": "Lily",
      "voiceId": "T5yFNwZamO7NrEhI9ZV6",
      "model": "eleven_v3",
      "chars": 34,
      "file": "A1_13_Lily.mp3",
      "bytes": 29301,
      "line": "What's missing this time, Grandad?"
